rgbstate: -- hello: capability bit 24
rgbstate: HELLO caps bit 24 RGB_SHOWN 1
rgbstate: lit at start: D7 83 left on 1 (ZMK's flag 1); shown: wanted 1, pc 0, idle 0, drawn 1, value 60, dim 100; the LEDs: lit 1, value 60: match
rgbstate: -- idle: ZMK turns the underglow off; the LEDs go dark and D7 83 says so
rgbstate: idle: D7 83 left on 0 (ZMK's flag 0); shown: wanted 1, pc 0, idle 1, drawn 0, value 0, dim 100; the LEDs: lit 0, value 0: match
rgbstate: D7 83 event: left lit 0
rgbstate: -- wake: lit again
rgbstate: woken: D7 83 left on 1 (ZMK's flag 1); shown: wanted 1, pc 0, idle 0, drawn 1, value 60, dim 100; the LEDs: lit 1, value 60: match
rgbstate: D7 83 event: left lit 1
rgbstate: -- the PC's frames light the LEDs through idle, while ZMK's flag says off (#605 case 1)
rgbstate: a scene draws: D7 83 left on 1 (ZMK's flag 1); shown: wanted 1, pc 1, idle 0, drawn 1, value 38, dim 100; the LEDs: lit 1, value 38: match
rgbstate: a scene draws while idle: D7 83 left on 1 (ZMK's flag 0); shown: wanted 1, pc 1, idle 1, drawn 1, value 38, dim 100; the LEDs: lit 1, value 38: match
rgbstate: D7 83 event: left lit 1
rgbstate: -- a black frame: the LEDs are dark while the user's on/off is on (#605 case 2)
rgbstate: a black frame: D7 83 left on 0 (ZMK's flag 1); shown: wanted 1, pc 1, idle 0, drawn 0, value 0, dim 100; the LEDs: lit 0, value 0: match
rgbstate: D7 83 event: left lit 0
rgbstate: -- hand-back: ZMK's own effect again
rgbstate: handed back: D7 83 left on 1 (ZMK's flag 1); shown: wanted 1, pc 0, idle 0, drawn 1, value 60, dim 100; the LEDs: lit 1, value 60: match
rgbstate: -- a breathe at its darkest is still on
rgbstate: breathe through black: D7 83 left on 1 (ZMK's flag 1); shown: wanted 1, pc 0, idle 0, drawn 0, value 0, dim 100; the LEDs: lit 0, value 0: match
rgbstate: -- sync off and on: the left's own lights don't change; the right is told
rgbstate: sync off: D7 83 left on 1 (ZMK's flag 1); shown: wanted 1, pc 0, idle 0, drawn 1, value 60, dim 100; the LEDs: lit 1, value 60: match
rgbstate: the right is sent: on 1, follow 0, look hue 30 sat 80 bri 60 effect 0
rgbstate: sync on: D7 83 left on 1 (ZMK's flag 1); shown: wanted 1, pc 0, idle 0, drawn 1, value 60, dim 100; the LEDs: lit 1, value 60: match
rgbstate: the right is sent: on 1, follow 1, look hue 30 sat 80 bri 60 effect 0
rgbstate: -- #624: a look change on the left (an invoke) goes to the right in the RGB op
rgbstate: kicked yes
rgbstate: the right is sent: on 1, follow 1, look hue 39 sat 70 bri 42 effect 3
rgbstate: a key that changed no look kicks: no
rgbstate: the left's new look: D7 83 left on 1 (ZMK's flag 1); shown: wanted 1, pc 0, idle 0, drawn 1, value 42, dim 100; the LEDs: lit 1, value 42: match
rgbstate: -- #624, as the right: rebooted with an older saved look, then the left's RGB op
rgbstate: the right shows hue 39 sat 70 bri 42 effect 3 (1 hsb, 1 effect writes)
rgbstate: the same op again writes 0 hsb, 0 effect
rgbstate: the right on the left's look: D7 83 left on 1 (ZMK's flag 1); shown: wanted 1, pc 0, idle 0, drawn 1, value 42, dim 100; the LEDs: lit 1, value 42: match
rgbstate: -- #618: the left keeps the right's shown state from the ring before its first status read
rgbstate: the subscribe's ring, lit: carried 0, D7 83 due 1
rgbstate: the subscribe's ring, lit: RGB_STATE's right shown: none
rgbstate: the first status read lands: RGB_STATE's right shown: lit 1, idle 1, following 1
rgbstate: the right goes dark: carried 1, D7 83 due 1
rgbstate: the right goes dark: RGB_STATE's right shown: lit 0, idle 1, following 1
rgbstate: the same ring again: carried 1, D7 83 due 0
rgbstate: the same ring again: RGB_STATE's right shown: lit 0, idle 1, following 1
rgbstate: a one-byte ring: carried 0, D7 83 due 0
rgbstate: after it: RGB_STATE's right shown: lit 0, idle 1, following 1
rgbstate: the link went: RGB_STATE's right shown: none
rgbstate: -- #618, as the right: the left idles while the PC reads the right and sends its colour
rgbstate: the right, follows the left on: the LEDs lit 1; shown lit 1, idle 1, following 1; ZMK's flag 1: match
rgbstate: the right, the left idles: the LEDs lit 0; shown lit 0, idle 1, following 1; ZMK's flag 0: match
rgbstate: the right, the left idle, with the PC's traffic: the LEDs lit 0; shown lit 0, idle 1, following 1; ZMK's flag 0: match
rgbstate: the right, a key on the left: the LEDs lit 1; shown lit 1, idle 1, following 1; ZMK's flag 1: match
rgbstate: -- done
